17:T50e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is studying in Germany free for every international student?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Tuition and fees depend on the state, institution and programme, and living costs still apply. Confirm the current fee schedule for the exact course."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where do I apply for DAAD EPOS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Applications are normally submitted to the selected eligible postgraduate course according to its instructions, not through one universal DAAD application. Check the current DAAD listing and course deadline."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is studying in Germany completely free for international students?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Tuition policy varies by institution and programme, and students still need to plan semester contributions, insurance, housing, food, travel and other costs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does every DAAD scholarship require work experience?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Requirements differ by programme. DAAD EPOS generally targets development-related postgraduate courses and relevant professional experience, but other awards use different rules."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--country","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/countries/germany/\",\"name\":\"Study in Germany: scholarships, admission, visa and costs\",\"description\":\"Plan study in Germany for 2027: compare scholarships, admission and uni-assist routes, deadlines, student visa evidence and blocked-account costs.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/countries/germany/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-31\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-22\",\"primary