1f:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[null,["$","section","1-Tuition-free is not cost-free",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Tuition-free is not cost-free"}],[["$","p","Many public institutions charge low or no tuition for selected programmes, yet students still need to plan for semester contributions, housing, insurance, travel and visa proof of funds. Some states or programmes charge tuition to non-EU students.",{"children":"Many public institutions charge low or no tuition for selected programmes, yet students still need to plan for semester contributions, housing, insurance, travel and visa proof of funds. Some states or programmes charge tuition to non-EU students."}],["$","p","DAAD's database is the best starting point for its current programmes. EPOS is aimed at applicants from eligible countries and generally expects relevant professional experience.",{"children":"DAAD's database is the best starting point for its current programmes. EPOS is aimed at applicants from eligible countries and generally expects relevant professional experience."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Check the exact programme language",{"children":"Check the exact programme language"}],["$","li","Use the official DAAD scholarship database",{"children":"Use the official DAAD scholarship database"}],["$","li","Confirm APS or document-verification rules where relevant",{"children":"Confirm APS or document-verification rules where relevant"}],["$","li","Compare city-level living costs",{"children":"Compare city-level living costs"}],["$","li","Review work-experience requirements carefully",{"children":"Review work-experience requirements carefully"}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-How to research a German programme",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to research a German programme"}],[["$","p","Check the university's programme page for language, subject prerequisites, application route and semester dates. Some applications go directly to the university, while others use uni-assist or another stated process. Follow the exact programme instructions.",{"children":"Check the university's programme page for language, subject prerequisites, application route and semester dates. Some applications go directly to the university, while others use uni-assist or another stated process. Follow the exact programme instructions."}],["$","p","For DAAD EPOS, applicants normally apply to an eligible postgraduate course and must meet course-specific deadlines. The programme is aimed at applicants from eligible developing and newly industrialised countries and generally expects at least two years of relevant professional experience.",{"children":"For DAAD EPOS, applicants normally apply to an eligible postgraduate course and must meet course-specific deadlines. The programme is aimed at applicants from eligible developing and newly industrialised countries and generally expects at least two years of relevant professional experience."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","3-Plan documents and visa evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Plan documents and visa evidence"}],[["$","p","Allow time for certified copies, translations and any country-specific academic verification. A scholarship decision does not remove the need to meet university admission and German immigration requirements.",{"children":"Allow time for certified copies, translations and any country-specific academic verification. A scholarship decision does not remove the need to meet university admission and German immigration requirements."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26"]}]
